title: "针对大语言模型生成粒子输运蒙卡程序的形式化核验器 (Formal Verifier for Large Language Model-Generated Monte Carlo Particle Transport Codes)"
abstract: "A formal verification and validation (V&V) system and a 190-task hierarchical benchmark for Large Language Model code generation in Monte Carlo particle transport simulations (Specialized for Geant4 C++ with multi-engine architectural roadmap)."
